# What counts as this project's own source, and what doesn't.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. An outside review of the doc apparatus (2026-09-15) led
# with a markdown-to-code mass ratio of 0.68:1 — a figure THIS PROJECT supplied.
# It was wrong: vendored libraries and exported notebook HTML had been counted as
# hand-written code. Re-measured honestly the ratio is ~1.98:1, so the review's
# thesis was understated, not overstated. The number then moved a third time
# (1.79:1) depending only on which directories the denominator admitted.
#
# ⚠️ A ratio that swings 3x on a packaging decision, with no prose changed, is
# measuring the repo's packaging, not its documentation practice. The fix is not
# a cleverer ratio — it is a denominator stated once, in a file the tooling reads,
# instead of re-derived by hand each time someone asks. That is what this is.
# (docs/external/REVIEW_doc_apparatus_2026-09-15_PREMISES.md, premise A2.)
#
# `linguist-vendored` = third party; we neither wrote nor maintain it.
# `linguist-generated` = build output; a tool produces it from something else
#   here, so editing it by hand is a mistake. Also collapses it in diff views,
#   which is wanted: CODEMAP.md alone churns ~600 lines on an unrelated PR.
#
# To recompute the ratio with this convention, see docs/STACK.md §"Mass".

# ── Third party ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Linguist's built-in heuristics already skip `vendor/` and `.min.js`, so these
# lines change nothing today. They are here anyway: an implicit convention that
# happens to work is how the 0.68 figure got published in the first place.
web/vendor/**                   linguist-vendored

# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Standalone evidence notebooks, exported to HTML by the deploy/refresh
# workflows from notebooks/standalone/*.ipynb. ~2.3 MB, and the single largest
# distortion: without this they are counted as hand-written HTML, which is what
# made web/index.html's 452 KB look like a sixth of the front end.
web/notebooks/*.html            linguist-generated
web/verified/*.html             linguist-generated

# ⚠️ Not generated — the hand-written landing page for /notebooks/. A later
# pattern wins in .gitattributes, so this exempts it from the line above.
web/notebooks/index.html        -linguist-generated

# Pipeline artifacts: main.py writes these and the site serves them. 16 MB.
web/data/**                     linguist-generated

# Regenerated by tools/codemap.py on every Edit/Write to web/index.html
# (PostToolUse hook in .claude/settings.json). Never edited by hand — CLAUDE.md
# says not to cite its line numbers for the same reason.
docs/CODEMAP.md                 linguist-generated
